  "policies": [
    "Clockwork Rager reads the existing genuine owner-turn index, including the current genuinely started turn. Soldier of the Infinite uses current Attack DoubleStats, not its printed3 or a fixed +3.",
    "Frostburn Matriarch checks actual Dark Gift identity attachments on a friendly physical HAND MINION and issues two attributed ordinary summons of the complete fixed FIR_901t. Ordinary buffs/keywords and gifts on board do not satisfy it. Capacity/replacements remain shared.",
    "Ancient of Yore uses the existing two-owner-start Dormancy lifecycle and classified controller-end dormant trigger. Armor then Draw are ordinary effects. Awakening removes eligibility without replacing the physical minion.",
    "Jailbird is a native repeated HAND progress listener for the original friendly card_prepared fact. Its stored reduction is the actual invested mana event.amount, excluding the prepared card extra1 discount. It does not itself acquire Prepare, and deck/board copies do not listen.",
    "Getaway Hogdriver uses exactly two ordinary original physical draw roots. Both roots must name MINION cards; burns still name actual drawn minions, fatigue is not a card, a cast-when-drawn spell root cannot be replaced by a later minion to satisfy the condition. Nested unrelated draws are not members. Charge is granted only to the same original continuous board residence, following existing face/control policy. Exact CWD/replacement and transformed-source windows remain local M6 policies.",
